    <string name="privacy_body">Your sets, favourites and copy history stay on this device, in storage only this app can read. There is no account, no cloud and no backend. The only part of the app that uses the internet is the advertising SDK (Huawei Petal Ads), which sends the advertising identifier (OAID), IP address, and device, network and app information in order to select an ad. Nothing you type or copy is ever sent anywhere.</string>
    <string name="ads_body">This app is free and has no subscription or in-app purchase. Ads pay for it. A banner appears on the topics and settings screens, and an ad may appear after you copy a set. No ad is ever shown on the screen where you are choosing tags.</string>
